<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 7 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 7 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 30</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............813,700 up.....3,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......728,000 up.....7,000</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......559,100 ........unch</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 7</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....858,316 up.....4,790</p>
<p> Financial companies.......660,621 up.....2,957</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,296 down...1,532</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,029 down...1,541</p>
</text>
